<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-23477] Calcite. Fix acception of incorrect date literal.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-23477</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Issues in the test &lt;em&gt;test_incorrect_timestamp.test&lt;/em&gt; can be fixed just by updating version of &lt;em&gt;Avatica&lt;/em&gt; version. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Exampe:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
CREATE TABLE tbl(t TIMESTAMP)
INSERT INTO tbl VALUES (&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;1900-02-35 00:00:00&apos;&lt;/span&gt;) 
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;passes instead of raising an incorrect date exception.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Adoption of #&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-15623&quot; title=&quot;Sql. Reject erroneous datetime literals.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-15623&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-15623&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
